MatchedObjectDescriptor.QualificationSummary:
Your resume must demonstrate at least one year of specialized experience at or equivalent to the GG-11 grade level or pay band in the Federal service or equivalent experience in the private or public sector. Specialized experience must demonstrate the following: 1) Evaluating, interpreting and integrating all-source intelligence information to develop top level intelligence assessments and reports;
2) Identifying intelligence gaps to develop collection requirements to fill those gaps;
3) Making effective and innovative use of product lines and vehicles to satisfy Acoustic Intelligence (ACINT) requirements; and,
4) Performing analysis and production tasks relative to Acoustic Intelligence (ACINT) to support operations. Additional qualification information can be found from the following Office of Personnel Management website: https://www.opm.gov/policy-data-oversight/classification-qualifications/general-schedule-qualification-standards/#url=List-by-Occupational-Series
